aylor, a leading expert in British genealogy."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1680, "end": 1833, "text": "\"Their marriage is a testament to the enduring legacy of the aristocracy, and we're delighted to have played a part in verifying this significant union.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1834, "end": 1954, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has yielded conclusive evidence that Philippa Rous is, indeed, married to Anthony Eyre."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1955, "end": 2083, "text": "This news is a testament to the power of rigorous research and the importance of verifying information through credible sources."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Paul Pelosi", "Anthony Eyre"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Paul Pelosi", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Anthony Eyre", "origin": "initial"}]}

